    <Description Value="XelVectors: reads SVG, SVGZ, WMF, EMF, CDR, MET, DXF, DWG, CGM, ODG, XAML, PS and EPS into an in-memory vector model, renders it with GDI+ (Windows) or Cairo (Linux) and writes SVG and EMF."/>
